a92ac92af0","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Storage.java: Add assertions to tasks and FILE_PATH variables","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":2,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"895084ca39d3e6c9ebef9a9d62bef4024b6b2146","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"TaskList.java: Protect internal task collection","messageBody":"TaskList exposes its mutable task collection through getTasks(), allowing other classes to modify the list without using TaskList operations.\n\nThis weakens TaskList\u0027s responsibility for managing tasks and can cause unexpected changes to the stored task list.\n\nReturn an unmodifiable copy of the task collection and depend on the List interface instead of the ArrayList implementation.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":6,"deletions":5}}},{"hash":"12277144a0109fe24d1ae6fdd87373b31400dee3","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Storage.java: Extract task serialization helpers","messageBody":"Storage mixes file operations with the details of converting tasks to and from the save-file format.\n\nThis makes the saveTasks and loadTasks methods longer than necessary and spreads storage format literals throughout the class.\n\nExtract task conversion into dedicated helper methods and replace the format literals with named constants.\n\nThis keeps the high-level save and load workflows easy to read while preserving the existing storage-file format.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":65,"deletions":26}}},{"hash":"c28343f56022ad97e34c5adaeed2942443bbd3a6","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Task.java: Encapsulate task state","messageBody":"Task exposes its description and completion state to subclasses and other classes in the package.\n\nDirect field access allows unrelated code to change task state without using Task\u0027s public operations.\n\nMake the task fields private and provide read-only accessors for the data needed by storage.\n\nKeep the description immutable because it is assigned only when a task is created.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":27,"deletions":10}}},{"hash":"e3bdfe2b701e9c24c8b63f654ef7de3bc3dd6555","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Ui.java: Remove duplicated display strings","messageBody":"Ui repeats the horizontal-line literal in multiple methods and stores fixed display text in mutable instance fields.\n\nDuplicated literals make later updates error-prone and obscure that the displayed text is shared application data.\n\nDefine the banner and horizontal line once as constants and use them wherever they are displayed.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":6,"deletions":6}}},{"hash":"20c385ace092f726adfd0602d8c74c58aa6bea5d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Benji.java: Extract task-saving helper","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":12,"deletions":8}}},{"hash":"c589ea8160b8a47fbdc2c7dbc222e220c6580b8f","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Storage.java: Improve corrupted-file handling","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":78,"deletions":9}}},{"hash":"47f726de3d9f639b28bba5c30e04b9618c199b4d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Benji.java: Use stream to filter matching tasks","messageBody":"The find command filters tasks in a loop while also building the\nnumbered response.\n\nSeparating the filtering step makes the matching logic clearer and\ndemonstrates the use of Java streams where filtering a collection is\nneeded.\n\nUse a stream to create a list of matching tasks, then keep a simple\nloop to number and display those tasks.\n","tags":["A-FullCommitMessage"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":36,"deletions":34}}},{"hash":"7acbd6a6ec402f12ec1a48f289891a5cd6e3f21b","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #1 from BenjaminWong33/branch-A-Assertions","messageBody":"Branch assertions","tags":["A-Assertions"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"49bc3c108f3999f189faaafc